Algorithm: Music Playlist Manager
1. Start the program.
2. Initialize the doubly linked list, circular linked list, stack, and queue.
3. Display the menu of operations.
4. Accept the user's choice.
5. If the user selects Add Song, insert the song into the playlist.
6. If the user selects Display Playlist, display all songs.
7. If the user selects Next Song, move to the next song.
8. If the user selects Previous Song, move to the previous song.
9. If the user selects Play in Loop, use the circular linked list to repeat songs.
10. If the user selects Recently Played, display songs stored in the stack.
11. If the user selects Add to Queue, insert the song into the queue.
12. If the user selects Play from Queue, remove and play the first queued song.
13. Repeat steps 3–12 until the user selects Exit.
14. Stop the program.
